  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.99,
      "end_seconds": 9.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.46,
      "end_seconds": 24.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "Doctor, um, it's electric shock pains in my cheek. It's getting on my nerves now. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.46,
      "end_seconds": 29.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.9,
      "end_seconds": 36.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "I mean, you know, it's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.91,
      "end_seconds": 37.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.75,
      "end_seconds": 43.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "I was on gliclazide before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.82,
      "end_seconds": 46.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.39,
      "end_seconds": 50.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.58,
      "end_seconds": 53.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.18,
      "end_seconds": 58.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with being afraid to eat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.46,
      "end_seconds": 62.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "So, any pain lasting seconds as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.04,
      "end_seconds": 67.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.74,
      "end_seconds": 77.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Okay, can you describe it it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.04,
      "end_seconds": 94.12,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say honestly, once or twice a day okay, so the being afraid to eat? That's been for ten days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Nothing like hearing loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.8,
      "end_seconds": 104.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "not that I've noticed, uh, no hearing loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.65,
      "end_seconds": 107.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.03,
      "end_seconds": 114.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.06,
      "end_seconds": 117.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.32,
      "end_seconds": 120.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 133.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.76,
      "end_seconds": 151.12,
      "duration_seconds": 16.36,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I walk the dog every morning. No, I share a house with my brother. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.74,
      "end_seconds": 155.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.67,
      "end_seconds": 159.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.81,
      "end_seconds": 163.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.04,
      "end_seconds": 168.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.52,
      "end_seconds": 174.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.18,
      "end_seconds": 180.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "I have diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.03,
      "end_seconds": 188.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Ah. Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.02,
      "end_seconds": 205.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.63,
      "end_seconds": 213.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.09,
      "end_seconds": 220.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.4,
      "end_seconds": 229.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.23,
      "end_seconds": 252.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, pulse is 80 beats a a minute, BP is 111 over 79, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.05,
      "end_seconds": 259.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.74,
      "end_seconds": 262.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.32,
      "end_seconds": 265.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.46,
      "end_seconds": 289.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Touching the right cheek sets off the pain and the face muscles work normally."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.15,
      "end_seconds": 295.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.14,
      "end_seconds": 316.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.75,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with trigeminal neuralgia at this stage. We should do an MRI scan of the head for facial pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 317.58,
      "end_seconds": 320.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.15,
      "end_seconds": 337.14,
      "duration_seconds": 15.99,
      "text": "I'm prescribing carbamazepine, 100 milligrams, twice a day, titrate. That That should help with nerve pain. Avoid known triggers and eat soft foods when it flares. Let's plan a check in four weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.35,
      "end_seconds": 341.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}